  "text": "I made no change to the RTL this visit. The simulation now passes with the files as they stand: `simulate` gave 3 passed on Verilator and 3 passed on Icarus.\n\nI couldn't reproduce the `test_start_while_busy` failure. The assertion that failed compared the model's GATE_ACTUAL with the bench value. It read 1800 in the model against 5000 in the RTL. The RTL had captured 5000, the new GATE_LEN, correctly. I traced that bench path and the model against the RTL and found nothing in `rtl/` that explains the 1800. I'm treating it as a stale or flaky earlier run rather than an RTL bug. I did not run the full `check` or the verification gates, so those are untested this visit.\n\nDONE"
